## Verification & Expected Outcome
Run `verify.sh` or inspect HPA:
```bash
kubectl get hpa web-app-hpa
```
Expected Output:
```
NAME          REFERENCE            TARGETS    MINPODS   MAXPODS   REPLICAS   AGE
web-app-hpa   Deployment/web-app   0%/80%     1         10        1          5m
```
HPA `TARGETS` must show a valid utilization percentage (e.g. `0%/80%`) instead of `<unknown>/80%`.
